---
---

<section class="manifesto" id="mission" aria-labelledby="mission-heading">
  <div
    class="m-bg"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>
  <div class="m-bg-cap" aria-hidden="true">Joseph, Oregon · Wallowa Valley</div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="m-hairline reveal">
      <span class="m-tag">ECFF 2026</span>
      <span class="m-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="m-mantra">
        Arrive as strangers · Experience awe together · Leave as Community
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="m-grid">
      <div class="m-lead reveal">
        <h2 id="mission-heading">
          A festival the size of a <span class="it">valley</span>,<br />
          built around a <span class="it">community</span>.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="m-body reveal">
        <p>
          ECFF is a three-day experience in Wallowa County focused on fostering
          resilient communities. It is more than a festival — film is the
          through-line, but the weekend is woven equally from live presentations,
          forums, music, food, and the kind of slow conversations that only
          happen when a whole valley shows up.
        </p>
        <p>
          We bring visitors — and some of the world's greatest minds — into
          conversation with the residents of Wallowa County, an example of a
          resilient community in action. Eighteen films across three historic
          theaters, six forums at Wallowa Lake Lodge, and food vendors and
          ranchers from within an hour of town. Workshops with directors, DPs,
          and editors who stay the whole weekend.
        </p>
        <p class="m-purpose">
          <span class="m-purpose-lbl">Our Mission —</span>
          to strengthen local community, deepen connection to the land, and
          create shared experiences through film; to give a voice to Wallowa
          County's values.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="m-stats reveal">
      <div class="m-stat">
        <div class="m-stat-num">3</div>
        <div class="m-stat-lbl">Days<br />in the valley</div>
      </div>
      <div class="m-stat">
        <div class="m-stat-num">18</div>
        <div class="m-stat-lbl">Films across<br />three theaters</div>
      </div>
      <div class="m-stat">
        <div class="m-stat-num">6</div>
        <div class="m-stat-lbl">Forums at<br />Wallowa Lake Lodge</div>
      </div>
      <div class="m-stat">
        <div class="m-stat-num">10</div>
        <div class="m-stat-lbl">Directors<br />in person, all weekend</div>
      </div>
      <div class="m-stat m-stat-wide">
        <div class="m-stat-num m-stat-word">Tickets are limited</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    background: var(--color-black);
    color: var(--color-offwhite);
    padding: 120px 0 96px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule-dark);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule-dark);
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .m-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url('/assets/joseph-aerial.jpg');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center 30%;
    opacity: 0.58;
    z-index: -2;
    filter: contrast(1.05) brightness(0.78) saturate(0.9);
  }
  .manifesto::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 0%,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42) 30%,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6) 70%,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88) 100%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse at 70% 30%,
        rgba(255, 219, 0, 0.05),
        transparent 60%
      );
    z-index: -1;
  }
  .m-bg-cap {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 18px;
    right: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(243, 239, 234, 0.4);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 36px;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ---- Header strip ---- */
  .m-hairline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule-dark);
  }
  .m-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-yellow);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .m-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-yellow);
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }
  .m-mantra {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: rgba(243, 239, 234, 0.7);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    flex: 1;
  }

  /* ---- Two-column lead ---- */
  .m-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    padding: 80px 0 64px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .m-lead h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(56px, 7vw, 104px);
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .m-lead h2 .it {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-yellow);
  }
  .m-body {
    padding-top: 14px;
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  .m-body p {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(243, 239, 234, 0.92);
    text-shadow: 0 1px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }
  .m-purpose {
    margin-top: 28px !important;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-yellow);
    background: rgba(255, 219, 0, 0.04);
    font-size: 16px !important;
    color: var(--color-offwhite) !important;
  }
  .m-purpose-lbl {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-yellow);
    margin-right: 6px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  /* ---- 5-cell stats strip ---- */
  .m-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr) 1.6fr;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule-dark);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule-dark);
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
  }
  .m-stat {
    padding: 28px 24px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--color-rule-dark);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 140px;
  }
  .m-stat:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }
  .m-stat-num {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(48px, 4.4vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-yellow);
  }
  .m-stat-word {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(40px, 4vw, 60px);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    text-transform: none;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .m-stat-lbl {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(243, 239, 234, 0.65);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .manifesto {
      /* Mobile section rhythm: 36px top/bottom across all sections — gives
         each section room to breathe between hairlines. */
      padding: 36px 0;
    }
    .m-bg {
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
    .m-bg-cap {
      display: none;
    }
    .container {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
    /* The mantra hairline is omitted on mobile — the title carries the
       section by itself, no need for a redundant tagline strip up top. */
    .m-hairline {
      display: none;
    }
    .m-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      /* No padding-top because the hairline is gone — title sits at the
         section's 22px top padding. 22px bottom matches the global mobile
         section rhythm. */
      padding: 0 0 22px;
    }
    .m-lead h2 {
      font-size: clamp(44px, 11vw, 64px);
    }
    .m-body p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .m-stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .m-stat {
      border-right: 1px solid var(--color-rule-dark);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule-dark);
      min-height: 120px;
      padding: 22px 18px;
    }
    .m-stat:nth-child(2n) {
      border-right: 0;
    }
    /* "Tickets are limited" — full-bleed cell, centered both axes. */
    .m-stat-wide {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 0;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .m-stat-wide .m-stat-num {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
